    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/persistenceunit/PersistenceUnitPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa.persistenceunit\"><code>PersistenceUnitPostProcessor</code></a> that will scan for classes annotated with <code>Entity</code> or\n<code>MappedSuperclass</code> and add them to the <code>PersistenceUnit</code> post processed. Beyond that\nJPA XML mapping files can be scanned as well by configuring a file name pattern.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/persistenceunit/PersistenceUnitPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa.persistenceunit\"><code>PersistenceUnitPostProcessor</code></a> 将扫描带有 <code>Entity</code> 或 <code>MappedSuperclass</code> 注解的类，并将它们添加到经过后处理的 <code>PersistenceUnit</code> 中。此外，还可以通过配置文件名模式来扫描 JPA XML 映射文件。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configures the file name pattern JPA entity mapping files shall be scanned from the classpath.",
      "translation": "配置从类路径中扫描 JPA 实体映射文件的文件名模式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
